    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">凝膠方塊靜靜的滑過地下城的走廊，在身後留下一條非常乾淨的通路，其行爲模式十分容易預測。它們分解活體組織，只留下骨頭和其他物質。<br />凝膠方塊幾乎全身透明，而這使得它們在攻擊之前很難被發現。由於受害者的骨頭、硬幣和其他物品漂浮在其體內，因此有好好進食的凝膠方塊會相對容易被發現。</span></p><p>Gelatinous cubes scour dungeon passages in silent, predictable patterns, leaving perfectly clean paths in their wake. They consume living tissue while leaving bones and other materials undissolved.</p><p>A gelatinous cube is all but transparent, making it hard to spot until it attacks. A cube that is well fed can be easier to spot, since its victims' bones, coins, and other objects can be seen suspended inside the creature.</p><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset rd__b-inset--readaloud\"><div class=\"rd__quote\"><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">“地下城的地板極其乾淨。這就是我們的第一條線索。”</em></span></p><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\">“<em>The dungeon's floors were spotless. That should have been our first clue.</em>”</p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:right;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">出自加斯特空翎Jaster Hollowquill第一次探索地脈迷城Undermountain的日誌</em></span></p><p><span class=\"rd__quote-by\">— From the journal of Jaster Hollowquill, on his first exploration of Undermountain</span></p></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
