    {
      "_id": "jNN3KwtYMFGm0Giy",
      "name": "吞沒Engulf",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "242",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">凝膠方塊移動不超過其速度的距離。此時它可以進入大型或更小體型生物所在空間內。當凝膠方塊以任何方式進入某生物所在空間時，該生物必須進行一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 12</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的敏捷豁免。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">豁免成功的生物可以選擇被方塊向後或向側面推離</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺。選擇不被推開的生物將承受與豁免失敗一樣的後果。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">豁免失敗時，方塊成功進入生物所佔據的空間位置。該生物將受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點強酸傷害並被吞沒。被吞沒的生物無法呼吸且被束縛，並在每次該方塊的回合開始時受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">21</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點強酸傷害。凝膠方塊移動時，被吞沒的生物也隨之一起移動。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">被吞沒的生物可以用一個動作進行一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 12</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的力量檢定以嘗試逃脫。檢定成功則意味着該生物成功逃脫，並進入方塊周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺範圍內的任一處空間位置。</span></p><p>The cube moves up to its speed. While doing so, it can enter Large or smaller creatures' spaces. Whenever the cube enters a creature's space, the creature must make a [[/save ability=dex dc=12]] saving throw.</p><p>On a successful save, the creature can choose to be pushed 5 feet back or to the side of the cube. A creature that chooses not to be pushed suffers the consequences of a failed saving throw.</p><p>On a failed save, the cube enters the creature's space, and the creature takes 10 ([[/damage 3d6 type=acid]]) damage and is engulfed. The engulfed creature can't breathe, is &amp;Reference[condition=restrained], and takes 21 ([[/damage 6d6 type=acid]]) damage at the start of each of the cube's turns. When the cube moves, the engulfed creature moves with it.</p><p>An engulfed creature can try to escape by taking an action to make a [[/save ability=str dc=12]] check. On a success, the creature escapes and enters a space of its choice within 5 feet of the cube.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
