    {
      "_id": "nECFVsqfq05KJUXa",
      "name": "泥怪方塊Ooze Cube",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "242",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">方塊佔據其所在空間位置的整個區域。其他生物可以進入該空間，但如此做的生物會承受凝膠方塊的吞沒能力，而其豁免具有劣勢。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">在方塊體內的生物可以被他人看到，但仍處於全身掩護狀態。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">方塊周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺範圍內的一個生物可以用一個動作將方塊內的生物或物件拖出。此時該生物還必須成功通過一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 12</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的力量檢定，且該生物必須承受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點強酸傷害。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">方塊至多可以同時容納一個大型生物，或至多</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">箇中型或更小體型的生物。</span></p><p>The cube takes up its entire space. Other creatures can enter the space, but a creature that does so is subjected to the cube's Engulf and has disadvantage on the saving throw.</p><p>Creatures inside the cube can be seen but have &amp;Reference[rule=totalcover]{total cover}.</p><p>A creature within 5 feet of the cube can take an action to pull a creature or object out of the cube. Doing so requires a successful [[/save ability=str dc=12]] check, and the creature making the attempt takes 10 ([[/damage 3d6 type=acid]]) damage.</p><p>The cube can hold only one Large creature or up to four Medium or smaller creatures inside it at a time.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
