    {
      "_id": "hxFbrSlTCtfPFklM",
      "name": "透明Transparent",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "242",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">即使凝膠方塊身處於肉眼可見的位置，觀察者仍然需要成功通過一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 15</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的感知（察覺）檢定來發現一個未移動且未發動攻擊的方塊。生物在未察覺的情況下嘗試進入凝膠方塊所在空間時，視爲被凝膠方塊突襲。</span></p><p>Even when the cube is in plain sight, it takes a successful [[/save ability=wis dc=15]] (&amp;Reference[skill=Perception]) check to spot a cube that has neither moved nor attacked. A creature that tries to enter the cube's space while unaware of the cube is @status[surprised] by the cube.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
